# High contrast theme
# Maximum legibility for accessibility (NFR-020).
#
# Every element is bold: this theme exists for readability, so weight is
# applied throughout rather than reserved for emphasis. Nothing here is
# dimmed, which is the attribute that would work against it.

HEADER=BrightWhite Bold
TIME=BrightWhite Bold
DATE=BrightWhite Bold
STATUS=BrightWhite Bold
FOOTER=BrightWhite Bold
ACCENT=BrightYellow Bold
ERROR=BrightRed Bold
ALERT=BrightYellow Bold Underline
